Step 19 – Prepare the deployment package
AgentCore Runtime runs on Linux ARM64, whereas your Mac runs macOS. We must package dependencies for the AgentCore Linux environment, not copy the packages from your local .venv. 
Amazon Bedrock AgentCore+1


We will use Python's pip to download the compatible packages. No Docker, Node.js or uv required.
