From your agent directory:
cd ~/student-agent-demo/agent

mkdir -p deployment_package

19.2 Install Linux ARM64 dependencies
Run:
python -m pip install \
  --target deployment_package \
  --platform manylinux2014_aarch64 \
  --implementation cp \
  --python-version 3.13 \
  --abi cp313 \
  --only-binary=:all: \
  -r requirements.txt
This command works on macOS/Linux and Windows Git Bash.

What is happening?
- --target: Installs packages into our deployment folder.
- --platform: Selects Linux ARM64 compatible packages.
- --python-version: Targets Python 3.13.
- --only-binary: Downloads compatible prebuilt wheels instead of compiling packages.
